    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Si Bane, de <i>The Dark Knight Rises</i>, connectait son masque signature à une machine CPAP, que dirait-il Before de l'allumer ? ",
      "n": "QuestionText1"
    },
    {
      "s": "Vous êtes tellement banal que vous pensez probablement que cette question vous concerne ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "707969_1",
      "n": "CategoryAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Un vaporisateur est un appareil qui... ah... vous savez quoi... Je ne veux même pas prétendre que celui-ci a raison. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "707981_1",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio3"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "IntroAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "707972_3",
      "n": "ChoicesAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio2"
    },
    {
      "s": "En parlant de stupide... ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "707977_1",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio1"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Un appareil CPAP fournit une circulation d’air aux personnes souffrant d’apnée du sommeil. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "707974_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Cela ne me dérange pas d’admettre que j’en utilise un, et cela m’a permis de dormir pendant la plupart des The Dark Knight Rises. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "707975_1",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "If Bane, from <i>The Dark Knight Rises</i> hooks his signature mask up to a CPAP machine, what would he say before turning it on?",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "707971_2",
      "n": "QuestionAudio"
    }
  ]
